Fonts (the javv-frontend image)
-------------------------------

The frontend serves two typefaces from its own files, taken from the Fontsource packages
(@fontsource/hanken-grotesk, @fontsource/spline-sans-mono). Both are licensed under the SIL Open
Font License, Version 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org). Each font file carries its copyright line
and the license URL in its own metadata, and each package carries the full license text.

